{"title": "iostat 采样写入负载（关键三列）", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/loop5 bs=256K oflag=direct &"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "iostat -dx /dev/loop5 1 3"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "loop5  ...  w_await  wareq-sz  ...  aqu-sz  %util"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "loop5  ...     0.38       512  ...    0.84  85.64"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "直写期间 aqu-sz 0.84、%util 85：队列真的在用、盘接近打满"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "调参前后各采一组对比 await 与 aqu-sz 才算数"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：Rocky Linux 9.3 容器 (sysstat 12.5.4)"}
]}
